{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dontCrossRiver-4285": "ALEXANDRA: （阿尔文说，这阵子先别过河……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-boulevardSweepView-4286": "ALEXANDRA: （等等，怎么这么多人？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-boulevardSweepView-4287": "ALEXANDRA: （啊！今天是追思日！电器店肯定关门了！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-boulevardSweepView-4288": "ALEXANDRA: （等等！佩罗先生不就住在店旁边吗？也许他手头就有压缩机。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-boulevardSweepView-4289": "ALEXANDRA: （好像在这里往东两条街……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-thatsPerot-4290": "ALEXANDRA: （应该就是佩罗先生家。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4291": "LOUIS: 亚历！太好了，你回来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4292": "ALEXANDRA: 路易舅舅？店里怎么开到这么晚？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4293": "LOUIS: 阿尔文说必须开着，看他的样子，好像是件很重要的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4294": "ALEXANDRA: （大概是为了给我们弄个不在场证明……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4295": "LOUIS: 那位女士还在楼上陪你妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4296": "ALEXANDRA: 护士！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexShopNightEntry-4297": "ALEXANDRA: 她几个小时前就该下班了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-louisAtNight-4298": "LOUIS: 抱歉，我得在下面看店，实在抽不开身去跟护士说一声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4299": "ALEXANDRA: 对不起……您等很久了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4300": "NURSE: 按规定，没人来接手照顾，我就不能走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4301": "NURSE: 到了这个地步，你母亲可能再也醒不过来了，应该把她送去城里的照护院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4302": "ALEXANDRA: 谢谢您来照顾她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4303": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文会把加班费付给您的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4304": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4305": "ALEXANDRA: 我很担心阿尔文。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4306": "ALEXANDRA: 自从你……我真希望……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4307": "ALEXANDRA: 有好多事，我都很担心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4308": "ALEXANDRA: 真希望还能像以前那样跟你说说话，不只是我一个人说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4309": "ALVIN: 嘿，亚历。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4310": "ALEXANDRA: 什么……阿尔文？几点了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4311": "ALVIN: 早上了，路易舅舅说有事找你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4312": "ALVIN: 我过几小时回来，应该能带个好消息。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4313": "ALEXANDRA: （不知道又出什么问题了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-nurseScene1-4314": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈，我很快回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-comingDownDay-4315": "LOUIS: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-comingDownDay-4316": "ALEXANDRA: （糟了……又怎么了？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue1-4317": "LOUIS: 亚历，冷藏库又开始升温了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue1-4318": "ALEXANDRA: （至少昨天已经把东西卖得差不多了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue1-4319": "LOUIS: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue1-4320": "ALEXANDRA: 我去电器店看看，能不能买个新压缩机。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue2-4321": "LOUIS: 亚历，冷藏库又开始升温了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue2-4322": "ALEXANDRA: （至少昨天已经把东西卖得差不多了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue2-4323": "LOUIS: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-condenserIssue2-4324": "ALEXANDRA: 我去电器店看看，能不能买个新压缩机。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4325": "ALEXANDRA: （好像在家……真不想这么冒昧地打扰。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4326": "MRS. PEROT: 哪位？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4327": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，您好，我……对不起，打扰……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4328": "MRS. PEROT: 哦，你是玛丽·欣的女儿吧？你叫什么来着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4329": "ALEXANDRA: 亚历珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4330": "MRS. PEROT: 进来吧，亲爱的，听说你妈妈的事，我很难过，有什么能帮上忙的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4331": "ALEXANDRA: 佩罗先生在吗？我知道今天大部分店都不开门……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotWife-4332": "MRS.PEROT: 哦，他在厨房，你尽管去找他吧，他在那儿也没干什么正经事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-Mrsperot-4333": "MRS. PEROT: 哦，亚历珊德拉，你好！好久不见了，我丈夫一直在找你呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-Mrsperot-4334": "MRS. PEROT: 今晚我要做奶酪焗土豆，给你家送些过去，你肯定没时间做饭吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4335": "PEROT: 谁……哦，亚历。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4336": "ALEXANDRA: 我，呃……您好，您好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4337": "PEROT: 什么风把你吹来了？今天可是假日。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4338": "ALEXANDRA: 是……呃，又是冷藏库。我觉得压缩机坏了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4339": "PEROT: 哦，对，你家那套老式勒梅尔机组，2200 型？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4340": "PEROT: 那个型号早没人卖了，也许能去废品场找些零件，但今天肯定不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4341": "ALEXANDRA: 好的，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4342": "PEROT: 亚历珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4343": "PEROT: 你妈妈的事，我很难过，还有什么需要，尽管开口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4344": "ALEXANDRA: 谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-perotIssue-4345": "PEROT: 还有什么需要，尽管开口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4346": "ALEXANDRA: （至少乳制品大部分都卖掉了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4347": "ALEXANDRA: （妈妈到底怎么能应付这么多事？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4348": "ALEXANDRA: （她从来不找别人帮忙。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4349": "????: 看来，你需要一点帮助。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4350": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？我没说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4351": "????: 要不要让我替你占卜一次？第一次免费。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4352": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，呃……也行，好吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTeller1-4353": "FORTUNE TELLER: 这边走，亲爱的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-tellerSon-4354": "MAN: 卡里埃夫人在右边的房间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-tellerSon-4355": "MAN: 有什么事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-fortuneTalk-4356": "FORTUNE TELLER: 在找什么吗，小姐？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4357": "FORTUNE TELLER: 请坐到我对面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4358": "ALEXANDRA: （也许她知道我找到的那些牌是什么……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4359": "FORTUNE TELLER: 我看得出来，你有很多心事，亲爱的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4360": "FORTUNE TELLER: 帮我切一下这副牌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4361": "FORTUNE TELLER: 那么，你知道这种占卜是怎么回事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4362": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……不知道，抱歉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4363": "FORTUNE TELLER: 这些牌不会替你预言未来，你的未来要由你自己创造。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4364": "FORTUNE TELLER: 这些牌只会显出你将要遇见的事。牌面看着也许有点……抽象，可这些牌确实知道些事情。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4365": "FORTUNE TELLER: 现在我们用这副牌玩一局。这是一项古老的仪式，无论输赢，都能帮你为将来的事做些准备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4366": "FORTUNE TELLER: 开始吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4367": "FORTUNE TELLER: 很好，按照习俗，新手赢了，老手就该送上一份礼物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4368": "获得生命宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4369": "FORTUNE TELLER: 哎，牌局有时就是这样，不过就算没能获胜，你也已经窥见了将来的一角。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4370": "ALEXANDRA: 其实……不好意思打断您，我还有个别的问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4371": "FORTUNE TELLER: 问吧，亲爱的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4372": "ALEXANDRA: 是这样，我找到了一些牌，呃……跟您的很像。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4373": "FORTUNE TELLER: 哎呀，这些牌你从哪儿得来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4374": "ALEXANDRA: 我……呃，别人留给我的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4375": "ALEXANDRA: 它们会不会……有魔法？就像古时候那样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4376": "FORTUNE TELLER: 哦，不会，那种魔法只存在于故事里，不过我去拿本古董图鉴，我们一起找找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4377": "ALEXANDRA: （不知道这些牌能不能卖掉？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4378": "ALEXANDRA: （也许够买个新的冷藏机组……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4379": "ALEXANDRA: 有人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4380": "ALEXANDRA: （嗯……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4381": "你……那份天赋……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4382": "ALEXANDRA: 什、什么……你是谁……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4383": "过来……这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4384": "MAN: 等等，她到底拿着什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4385": "FORTUNE TELLER: 一副神谕牌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4386": "MAN: 你不也有？有什么了不起的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4387": "FORTUNE TELLER: 不一样！她那副牌属于最初的阿尔卡那牌组，根本不能用钱来衡量！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4388": "MAN: 那你怎么不直接从她口袋里顺出来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4389": "FORTUNE TELLER: 真正的神谕牌，光抢过来是没有用的！得由她把牌交给我们，牌的力量才能为我们所用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4390": "MAN: 所以你打算把她扣在这里，直到她——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4391": "FORTUNE TELLER: 抓住她！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4392": "FORTUNE TELLER: 她去哪儿了？不可能跑得那么快啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4393": "ALEXANDRA: （他们没看见我……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4394": "ALEXANDRA: （我到底怎么上来的？刚才的一切都模模糊糊的……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexOracleScene-4395": "ALEXANDRA: （得找条下去的路……不能被他们看见。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4396": "ALEXANDRA: （不行……我好像真的撑不住了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4397": "ALEXANDRA: （可还有那么多事没做……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4398": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文，我，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4399": "ALVIN: 亚历，你脸色真差。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4400": "ALEXANDRA: 真好，谢谢啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4401": "ALVIN: 我不是那个意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4402": "ALVIN: 你得睡一觉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4403": "ALEXANDRA: 得先喂妈妈吃饭，再修冷藏库。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4404": "ALEXANDRA: 然后还有一大堆别的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4405": "ALVIN: 我又雇了一位护士，过几小时就到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4406": "ALVIN: 最近我的生意不错，你可以买新的冷藏机组，想买什么都行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4407": "ALVIN: 店照常开着就好，赚不赚钱无所谓，明白吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4408": "ALVIN: 我会安排好一切，你先睡一觉，我们晚点再谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4409": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈……对不起。我只是……得睡一会儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralStart-4410": "ALEXANDRA: （就一个小时吧……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinAstral-4411": "ALEXANDRA: （这是什么地方……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinAstral-4412": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinAstral-4413": "ALVIN: 走吧，亚历。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinAstral-4414": "ALVIN: 我们得去找妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-astralCrossing-4415": "内容放这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4416": "CREATURE: 孩子，你是怎么过桥的？星界之桥不能独自穿越。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4417": "ALEXANDRA: 我不是一个人，我和阿尔文在一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4418": "CREATURE: 他并没有真的来到这里，你怎么将他幻化出来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4419": "ALEXANDRA: 我想，我是在做梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4420": "CREATURE: 若是在梦中来到这里，你依然是个人类倒也说得通。但你又是如何绕过王室法令的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4421": "ALEXANDRA: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4422": "CREATURE: 国王与王后彼此猜忌，因此颁下法令：穿行星界，至少要有两人同行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroidEncounter-4423": "CREATURE: 这片星界会让你看到不愿面对的事物，孩子，旅途中务必小心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroid-4424": "CREATURE: 自那场风暴与黑暗以来，我便一直在此等待。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-monstroid-4425": "CREATURE: 我不知道自己是遭到放逐，还是两位陛下仅仅将我遗忘了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4426": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4427": "肉……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4428": "肉……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4429": "ALEXANDRA: 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4430": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文，等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4431": "ALVIN: 我们得去找妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4432": "ALEXANDRA: 不能就这么丢下她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-meetJuna-4433": "ALEXANDRA: 你可以跟我们一起走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4434": "ALEXANDRA: 这是哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4435": "ALVIN: 外公外婆家，你应该不记得他们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4436": "ALEXANDRA: 那是妈妈吗？她好年轻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4437": "CLOTAIRE: 他到底要去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4438": "MARIE: 回他的故乡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4439": "MATHILDE: 他以前也回去过，不是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4440": "MARIE: 可他留下的字条里没说什么时候回来，只说自己很早就知道有一天必须离开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4441": "CLOTAIRE: 既然早就知道要走，倒也没耽误他再生一个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4442": "MATHILDE: 你怀孕的事，跟他说过了吧……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4443": "MARIE: 妈妈……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-kitchenScene-4444": "MATHILDE: 怎么，这种事你不该告诉他吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-marieDisappears-4445": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-marieDisappears-4446": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4447": "ALEXANDRA: 这又是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4448": "????: 阿尔文，我要你拨动控制面板上的开关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4449": "ALVIN: 可你说过，我不准动！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4450": "????: 没错，你要让空气替你拨动，我知道你做得到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4451": "ALVIN: 我不知道怎么让空气……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4452": "????: 我来再给你加点刺激。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4453": "ALVIN: 不，那里什么都没有！什么都没有！我什么也做不到！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4454": "ALEXANDRA: 住手！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4455": "ALEXANDRA: 让我来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4456": "ALEXANDRA: 只要关掉那个开关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alvinPastScene-4457": "ALEXANDRA: 也许这样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer1-4458": "那份饥饿……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer2-4459": "我们醒来时，田野已是一片漆黑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer2-4460": "旧日的咒法，没有一道能挽救收成。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer3-4461": "大地一直在震……每天，都震得那么厉害。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer4-4462": "没有食物，连我的孩子都没东西吃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer5-4463": "地震终于停了，可我们走过的每个村庄，都陷在混乱里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dreamer0-4464": "你不该在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4465": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4466": "????: 玛丽是你的母亲？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4467": "????: 你多大了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4468": "ALEXANDRA: 你在对我妈妈做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4469": "????: 有件事，需要用到她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4470": "????: 除非……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4471": "ALEXANDRA: 放开我妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4472": "ALEXANDRA: 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4473": "ALEXANDRA: 好疼……他对我做了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4474": "ALEXANDRA: 一大块紫色的印记……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4475": "ALEXANDRA: 这是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4476": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么了？我要醒了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4477": "ALEXANDRA: 我不明白，你想做什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4478": "ALEXANDRA: 你在……地上画什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4479": "ALEXANDRA: 是一只……鸟？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4480": "ALEXANDRA: 我不明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4481": "LOUIS: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4482": "ALEXANDRA: 什么……几点了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4483": "LOUIS: 早上了，星期二早上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4484": "LOUIS: 抱歉叫醒你，不过阿尔文刚让人送了一堆机器到楼下，你能下来看看吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4485": "ALEXANDRA: 好……我马上下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4486": "ALEXANDRA: （手上的印记还在……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4487": "<align=\"center\">一周后……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4488": "ALEXANDRA: 总之，新的冷藏机组很好用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4489": "ALEXANDRA: 就是那个电源，我完全弄不明白它的原理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4490": "ALEXANDRA: 不过，至少能用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-lanetesEncounter-4491": "ALEXANDRA: 护士几分钟前打过电话，很快就到，我得去帮路易舅舅打烊了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4492": "ALEXANDRA: （还是回家吧？他们应该不会追那么远。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4493": "ALEXANDRA: （好，装自然点，这可是大街上。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4494": "ALEXANDRA: （可以躲进前面的人群！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4495": "SPEAKER: ……因此，我很荣幸，在此为阿什沃先生完成的雕塑揭幕。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4496": "SPEAKER: 他特意选在追思日举行落成仪式，却并非为了悼念那数百万逝者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4497": "SPEAKER: 他希望赋予这一天新的意义。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4498": "ALEXANDRA: （他们……好像没发现我。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4499": "SPEAKER: 他更希望我们铭记那些远道而来的旅人。他们从东方、从世界各地赶来，向我们伸出了援手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4500": "ALEXANDRA: （事情太多了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4501": "SPEAKER: 当年，我们的先辈已濒临饿死，正是那时，旅人的援助队伍赶到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4502": "ALEXANDRA: （都怪阿尔文那个笨蛋，连有人跟踪我，都不敢告诉警察……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4503": "SPEAKER: 他们汇聚智慧，不懈努力，重建了塞伦，也挽救了我们的文明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4504": "ALEXANDRA: （这些牌一定得脱手，既然那么值钱，也许能卖掉？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4505": "SPEAKER: 我们致敬他们的劳动、牺牲、知识[oxfordComma /]以及让文明重获新生的壮举。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4506": "ALEXANDRA: （那些怪人好像走了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4507": "OLD WOMAN: 能安静点吗？这是纪念仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4508": "ALEXANDRA: 对不起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-serenClimbDown-4509": "ALEXANDRA: （还是回家吧，他们不敢惹阿尔文。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dontWannaWalk-4510": "ALEXANDRA: （不想再从他们家门前经过了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-dontWannaWalk2-4511": "ALEXANDRA: （我可不回那里去……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexNapCap-4512": "ALEXANDRA: （今天就回屋休息了吗？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexNapCap-4513": "还没……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexNapCap-4514": "可以了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexNapCap-4515": "ALEXANDRA: （还是去看看妈妈吧。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenDay.yarn-alexNapCap-4516": "ALEXANDRA: （有点头晕。）"
}
